<h1>Subexpressions</h1>

{{! Parentheses nest one helper's result as another's argument, so you
    don't need intermediate variables. Helpers are in helpers.js. }}

<p>{{upper (concat first last)}}</p>

<p>You scored {{score}} — {{#if (gt score 50)}}pass ✓{{else}}fail ✗{{/if}}</p>

<p>{{repeat "ab" (add 1 2)}}</p>

<p>First non-empty: {{or nickname username "anonymous"}}</p>
